{{Quote|A smoke-infused flail that strikes with disorienting swings.|Item}}
The '''Flail''' (formerly known as Jitte) is a {{Rare}} [[sword]].

The Flail does not have many uses, but it does allow for spectacular mobility, with '''[X] Smoke Apparition''' working like a second flashstep.

However, due to unusually high mastery requirements, low drop rate, and mediocre damage, it only works in extremely niche scenarios.

==Obtainment==
The Flail can be obtained after defeating [[Smoke Admiral]], who is located at the [[Hot and Cold]] in the [[Second Sea]].

