==Trivia==
* The Flail is used by the [[Smoke Admiral]] and the [[Tyrant of the Skies]].
* The Flail is the only weapon used by two [[bosses]].
** However, it is only dropped by one of them.
* Flail is not a typical [[Swords|sword]], but actually a spin-off of {{w|Morning_star_(weapon)|Morning Star}}. It was typically used by the cavalry in the medieval times.
* There is a client-side glitch where the Flail can appear in a weird position on the user's back.
* When [[Leopard]] was reworked to [[Tiger]], the name of the [Z] move also changed from "Smoke Leopard" to "Smoke Tiger".

